## Purpose
- Pin Team Hub HTTP error contract to RFC 9457 Problem Details.

## Source of truth
- `building-blocks/TeamHub.Observability/Problems/ProblemTypes.cs`
- `building-blocks/TeamHub.Observability/Problems/TeamHubProblemDetailsFactory.cs`
- `building-blocks/TeamHub.Observability/Middleware/ExceptionMiddleware.cs`
- Service mappers: `OrganizationExceptionMapper`, `RedisUnavailableExceptionMapper`

## Do
- Content-Type: `application/problem+json`.
- Required fields: `type`, `title`, `status`, `detail` (when useful), `instance` (request path).
- Always include extension `correlationId`.
- Include `sessionId` when auth set `HttpContext.Items["SessionId"]`.
- In Development only: unhandled errors may include `stackTrace`.
- Clients switch on `type`, not only HTTP status.
- Base URI: `https://teamhub.dev/problems/{suffix}`.

### Shared types
| suffix | HTTP | when |
|--------|------|------|
| `internal` | 500 | unhandled exception |
| `validation-failed` | 400 | ModelState / FluentValidation / domain validation |
| `unauthorized` | 401 | missing/invalid auth for intentional controller returns |
| `forbidden` | 403 | authenticated but not allowed |
| `conflict` | 409 | business conflict (duplicate, sole owner leave, …) |
| `service-unavailable` | 503 | dependency down (Redis, blob storage) |

### Organization
| suffix | HTTP | when |
|--------|------|------|
| `organization-not-found` | 404 | org / related entity missing |
| `forbidden` | 403 | not a member / missing permission |
| `conflict` | 409 | duplicate slug, sole owner leave, … |
| `validation-failed` | 400 | domain / avatar validation |
| `service-unavailable` | 503 | blob storage not configured |

### Auth
| suffix | HTTP | when | extensions |
|--------|------|------|------------|
| `invalid-credentials` | 401 | bad login | `code=AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS`, `remainingAttempts`, `lockoutSeconds` |
| `account-locked` | 423 | login lockout | `code=AUTH_LOCKED`, `remainingAttempts`, `lockoutSeconds` |
| `unauthorized` | 401 | refresh / change-password identity failure | |
| `conflict` | 409 | register duplicate username/email | `errors` (ValidationProblemDetails) |
| `service-unavailable` | 503 | Redis unavailable | |

### Validation
- Format / ModelState → `ValidationProblemDetails` with `type=…/validation-failed` and `errors`.
- Business field conflicts (register) → `ValidationProblemDetails` with `type=…/conflict` and `errors`.

## Don't
- Do not invent per-endpoint custom error DTOs for REST.
- Do not use `https://httpstatuses.com/{code}` as `type`.
- Do not put stack traces in non-Development responses.
